   'Havana honors Italian Army C.le Magg. Sc. Roberto Marchini, 28, of Viterbo, Italy, of the 8th Airborne Combat Engineer Regiment, Folgore Brigade. He died during a reconnaissance mission in Afghanistan''s Bakwa district on July 12, 2011. He did CrossFit on base with whatever he could find, and his favorite exercises were double-unders, push-ups and power cleans.

You have 25 minutes to complete as many rounds as you can of 150 double-unders, 50 push-ups and 15 power cleans (185 lb / 125 lb). Each round is 215 reps. The 150 double-unders take most of the time, and the heavy power cleans arrive with tired arms from the push-ups.',
   '[{"name": "Double-Unders", "reps": "150", "tip": "Break into steady sets before you start tripping. Relax your shoulders."}, {"name": "Push-Ups", "reps": "50", "tip": "Chest to the floor and full lockout. Break early, such as 5 sets of 10."}, {"name": "Power Cleans", "reps": "15", "tip": "Heavy for most people. Fast singles with a flat back.", "rx_men": "185 lb", "rx_women": "125 lb"}]'::jsonb,
   'Score is total rounds + reps.',
