   'Hoover honors Staff Sgt. Taylor Hoover, 31, of the U.S. Marine Corps, who was assigned to the 2nd Battalion, 1st Marine Regiment, 1st Marine Division at Camp Pendleton. He joined the Marines in September 2010 and deployed five times. He was killed on Aug. 26, 2021, when a suicide bomber detonated explosives at Abbey Gate in Kabul, Afghanistan.

You complete 8 rounds of a 400 m run, 15 burpee box jump-overs (24 in / 20 in), 10 calories on an Air Bike and 6 alternating dumbbell snatches (75 lb / 50 lb). The heavy dumbbell and the burpees push your heart rate up every round, so the run and the bike are where you settle your pace.',
   '[{"name": "Run", "reps": "400 m", "tip": "Hold the same pace on all 8 rounds."}, {"name": "Burpee Box Jump-Over", "reps": "15", "tip": "Chest to the floor, then jump or step over the box. Find a steady rhythm.", "rx_men": "24 in", "rx_women": "20 in"}, {"name": "Air Bike", "reps": "10 cal", "tip": "Push and pull with your arms as well as your legs."}, {"name": "Alternating Dumbbell Snatches", "reps": "6", "tip": "Switch hands each rep and lock out overhead. Keep the dumbbell close.", "rx_men": "75 lb", "rx_women": "50 lb"}]'::jsonb,
   'Record your finish time.',
