   'Jennifer honors Canadian 1st Class Constable Jennifer Kovach, 26, of Guelph, Canada, who served her community with the Guelph Police Service for four years. She died on March 14, 2013, when her squad car was involved in a crash while she was responding to a call for service.

You have 26 minutes to complete as many rounds and reps as you can of 10 pull-ups, 15 kettlebell swings (53 lb / 35 lb) and 20 box jumps (24 in / 20 in). Each round is 45 reps. None of the movements is very heavy, so the challenge is keeping a steady pace for the whole 26 minutes.',
   '[{"name": "Pull-Ups", "reps": "10", "tip": "Chin over the bar on every rep. Break into small sets before your grip fades."}, {"name": "Kettlebell Swings", "reps": "15", "tip": "Drive with your hips and swing the bell overhead.", "rx_men": "53 lb", "rx_women": "35 lb"}, {"name": "Box Jumps", "reps": "20", "tip": "Land softly with your whole foot on the box and stand up tall.", "rx_men": "24 in", "rx_women": "20 in"}]'::jsonb,
