   'Jenny honors U.S. Army Capt. Jennifer M. Moreno, 25, of San Diego, California, who was assigned to Madigan Army Medical Center on Joint Base Lewis-McChord in Washington state. She was killed on Oct. 6, 2013, in Zhari District, Afghanistan, when enemy forces attacked her unit with an improvised explosive device.

You have 20 minutes to complete as many rounds and reps as you can of 20 overhead squats, 20 back squats and a 400 m run. The barbell is light (45 lb / 35 lb), but 40 squats and a run every round wear out your legs quickly. The overhead squats also test your shoulder mobility and balance.',
